    <string name="tips_title">How to play</string>
    <string name="tips_message">Tap any tile in the empty row/column to slide it.\nSwipe a tile toward the gap — or drag it and it follows your finger.\n\nTwo fingers: pinch to zoom, pan to explore (great on big boards).\nLong-press the board to peek at the full picture.\nDouble-tap to reset the zoom.\n\nKeyboard: arrows or WASD move tiles.\n📅 is the Daily Challenge — the same scramble for everyone!</string>

